        en: { name: 'Cape Kaliakra', description: 'A narrow rocky headland jutting 2 km into the Black Sea, with the remains of a medieval fortress and cliffs up to 70 m high. People come for sunsets and seabird views.', tip: 'Walk to the very tip and shoot against the cliff and the sea; the best light is one to two hours before sunset. It is windy, so bring a jacket; Varna is about an hour away by car or by bus to Kavarna.' },
